  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to organisation working on negotiations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing support to an organization dedicated to investing in the human capital of leaders in the Middle East, with the aim of empowering those who influence today&#x2019;s decision-making processes to transform conflict and foster a brighter future for the region. The organization acts as a platform for leaders to learn, build networks, and explore innovative approaches to complex challenges. While the deeply rooted issues in the Middle East lack quick solutions, there is a growing recognition of the need to enhance negotiation practices, reflect on entrenched patterns of thinking and behaviour, and to sustain informal communication across diverse groups. Additionally, the initiative includes specialized support for local leadership development.</narrative>
  </description>
